Information Fasttree:\
\pard\pardeftab720\partightenfactor0

\fs32 \cf3 \'a0\
Fasttree is a software program that we use for it speed and efficiency in generating a phylogenetic tree. It gets as input an aligned nucleotide or protein sequence (FASTA or PHYLIP format). As output, we want a well-structured newick-format, which we want to use for its input at the visualization tool. Fastree use an approximation of maximum likelihood method. This means that it constructs phylogenetic trees while maintaining a balance between accuracy and computational efficiency.\
\'a0\
How to install the Fasttree toolkit:\
\'a0\
Go to your terminal at your computer and follow these steps:\
\'a0\
\pard\pardeftab720\li960\fi-480\partightenfactor0

\f1 \cf3 \'b7
\f2\fs18\fsmilli9333 \'a0\'a0\'a0\'a0\'a0 
\f0\fs32 wget {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "http://www.microbesonline.org/fasttree/FastTree"}}{\fldrslt \cf4 \ul \ulc4 http://www.microbesonline.org/fasttree/FastTree}} -O ~/FastTree\uc0\u8232 \u8232 \

\f1 \'b7
\f2\fs18\fsmilli9333 \'a0\'a0\'a0\'a0\'a0 
\f0\fs32 chmod +x ~/FastTree\uc0\u8232 \u8232 \

\f1 \'b7
\f2\fs18\fsmilli9333 \'a0\'a0\'a0\'a0\'a0 
\f0\fs32 echo 'export PATH=$HOME:$PATH' >> ~/.bashrc\uc0\u8232 \u8232 \

\f1 \'b7
\f2\fs18\fsmilli9333 \'a0\'a0\'a0\'a0\'a0 
\f0\fs32 source ~/.bashrc\
\pard\pardeftab720\partightenfactor0
{\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://morgannprice.github.io/fasttree/"}}{\fldrslt \cf4 \ul \ulc4 https://morgannprice.github.io/fasttree/}}\
\pard\pardeftab720\partightenfactor0
